efix ?? 'mrg'}_${String(n).padStart(3, '0')}`,\n      hits: [...cur],\n      originalSlice: input.original.slice(start, end),\n      residualSlice: input.residual.slice(start, end),\n    })\n    cur = []\n  }\n\n  for (let i = 1; i < sorted.length; i++) {\n    const prev = cur[cur.length - 1]!\n    const next = sorted[i]!\n    if (next.start < prev.end) {\n      // 重叠命中：并进当前簇\n      cur.push(next)\n      continue\n    }\n    const gap = input.original.slice(prev.end, next.start)\n    if (isTightMaskGap(gap)) {\n      cur.push(next)\n    } else {\n      flush()\n      cur = [next]\n    }\n  }\n  flush()\n  return clusters\n}\n\n/** 全书 plains：按 unit 顺序扫紧贴 mask 簇（保持 A1 前后序） */\nexport function buildS0TightMergeClusters(input: {\n  plains: PlainText[]\n  residualPlains: PlainText[]\n  s0: BookNounDraft[]\n}): S0TightCluster[] {\n  if (input.plains.length !== input.residualPlains.length) {\n    throw new Error('buildS0TightMergeClusters: plains 与 residual 长度必须一致')\n  }\n  const out: S0TightCluster[] = []\n  for (let i = 0; i < input.plains.length; i++) {\n    const original = input.plains[i]!.T\n    const residual = input.residualPlains[i]!.T\n    const hits = listS0MaskHitsInText(original, input.s0, i)\n    out.push(\n      ...clusterTightS0MaskHits({\n        original,\n        residual,\n        hits,\n        clusterIdPrefix: `p${String(i).padStart(4, '0')}`,\n      }),\n    )\n  }\n  return out\n}\n\n/**\n * 合并审查通过后：用更长连续原文替换被合并的短串。\n * 短串若仍在别处独立出现，保留（只删「整串全等且本次被合并掉」的条目需由调用方传 removed）。\n */\nexport function applyS0MergeSurfaces(\n  s0: BookNounDraft[],\n  merges: Array<{ mergedText: string; parts: string[] }>,\n): BookNounDraft[] {\n  const remove = new Set<string>()\n  const add: string[] = []\n  for (const m of merges) {\n    const merged = m.mergedText.replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim()\n    if (merged.length < 2) continue\n    add.push(merged)\n    for (const p of m.parts) {\n      const c = nounCanonical(p)\n      if (c) remove.add(c)\n    }\n  }\n  const kept = s0.filter((d) => !remove.has(nounCanonical(d.text)))\n  return dedupeNounDrafts([\n    ...kept,\n    ...add.map((text) => ({ text })),\n  ])\n}\n\n/** 仅纯原文 T；不含 bookKey / page（材料面与地址分离） */\nexport function collectPlainTexts(bookIndex: BookIndex): PlainText[] {\n  const plains: PlainText[] = []\n  for (const c of bookIndex.chunks) {\n    if (!isRetrievableAtom(c)) continue\n    const T = stripMarkupNoise(atomSearchText(c))\n    if (T.trim().length < 4) continue\n    plains.push({ T })\n  }\n  return plains\n}\n\nexport function extractS0FromPlainTexts(plains: PlainText[]): BookNounDraft[] {\n  const map = new Map<string, string>() // canon → first text\n  const hit = new Map<string, number>()\n\n  const bump = (raw: string) => {\n    const text = raw.replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim()\n    if (isNoiseSurface(text)) return\n    const canon = nounCanonical(text)\n    if (!map.has(canon)) map.set(canon, text)\n    hit.set(canon, (hit.get(canon) ?? 0) + 1)\n  }\n\n  for (const { T } of plains) {\n    // 短串入表；短语合并留给相邻 mask → LLM\n    for (const s of listS0CandidateSpans(T)) bump(s.text)\n  }\n\n  const drafts: BookNounDraft[] = []\n  for (const [canon, text] of map) {\n    if ((hit.get(canon) ?? 0) >= 80 && canon.length <= 2) continue\n    drafts.push({ text })\n  }\n  drafts.sort((a, b) =>\n    nounCanonical(a.text).localeCompare(nounCanonical(b.text)),\n  )\n  return drafts\n}"}
